{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7001_p", "source_sha256": "25ffd6872d21355e1b68474bb389acbdb9e7226332b515ee10b02e4f73ac08d5", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n貴音は『人を惑わす悪魔』というテーマの写真を撮る）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n贵音要拍摄主题为“迷惑人心的恶魔”的照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7002_008tak", "source_sha256": "8b8eb69815da5a7aa128b27f9da55d95589c506115a51751f1ee6c5a4a3af0aa", "ja": "{$P$}、本日の撮影ですが……\n演技が不要と聞きましたが、なぜでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，听说今天的拍摄不需要演技……这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7003_008tak", "source_sha256": "893d38abc7920d97dd608892a05053bcc43e6ca0b7799891b7ebe72046f2db6d", "ja": "『人を惑わす悪魔』が題材とのこと。\n私なりに、色々と思案してきたのですが……。", "zh": "听说主题是『蛊惑人心的恶魔』。\n我也按照自己的方式，思考了许多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7004_p", "source_sha256": "1a00e1471788abb6dca2eb91cd3ec618d5143cd012730841dc8898b9f7905d9e", "ja": "ごめん、俺が提案したんだ。貴音は自然体の姿でも\n十分、人を惑わす魅力があると思ったから。", "zh": "抱歉，是我提议的。因为我觉得，贵音即使是不加修饰的样子，\n也拥有足以迷惑他人的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7005_008tak", "source_sha256": "75332bbe70ae267eb6a5cfafcbf542885f44f09ebcb6430dc4402442796aee06", "ja": "そうでしたか……。あの、{$P$}は\n私のどこに、そのような魅力を感じたのですか？", "zh": "原来是这样……那个，{$P$}觉得我身上的什么地方有那样的魅力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7006", "source_sha256": "28d00c78273dc395fc48aefc9acd6eccca3554b275fc2a93fc9ca0aae5f3918e", "ja": "瞳", "zh": "瞳", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7007", "source_sha256": "f7b1cfd6e068c891ef43fd564f10794d9c0ee19015040f5347325926044c1cf9", "ja": "雰囲気", "zh": "氛围", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7200_p", "source_sha256": "7d861ac2be25d1bdb2fb39fb3aede2d5609d0840ab8f1220ebab41e27812be09", "ja": "そうだな。色々あるけど……瞳かな。とても印象的で\n見ていると、心を惑わされる気がするんだ。", "zh": "也是呢。虽然有很多……但应该还是眼睛吧。非常令人印象深刻，\n看着看着，感觉心神都要被勾走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7201_008tak", "source_sha256": "32aedcf455262fb78789778c0851da60398e9c2ca00641998a06f25f627075c6", "ja": "なるほど、{$P$}には、\n私の瞳がその様に映っているのですね。", "zh": "原来如此，在{$P$}眼中，我的双眸是那样的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7202_008tak", "source_sha256": "6f1c559037f1a7a25980cc1f5f6a78d022b835ac4a27ad0defb17f23c9c96b3a", "ja": "それならば……このまま見つめていましょう。\n……じーっ。ふふ♪", "zh": "既然如此……那就继续这样凝视吧。\n……盯——。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7300_p", "source_sha256": "7d861ac2be25d1bdb2fb39fb3aede2d5609d0840ab8f1220ebab41e27812be09", "ja": "そうだな。色々あるけど……瞳かな。とても印象的で\n見ていると、心を惑わされる気がするんだ。", "zh": "也是呢。虽然有很多……但应该还是眼睛吧。非常令人印象深刻，\n看着看着，感觉心神都要被勾走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7301_008tak", "source_sha256": "77ec375cfdcf080bf8d78496747aed91ff82d1b339e172f4c2c6254c10bffc3a", "ja": "つまり悪魔的な瞳……ということでしょうか。\n私に、そのような力があったとは……。", "zh": "也就是说，是恶魔般的双眸……这个意思吗？  \n没想到我竟然拥有那样的力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7302_008tak", "source_sha256": "4f40c19fe675b6703523698021feea7fa46e17695aded79501dd20f2c962bdd5", "ja": "これは……喜んで良いのでしょうか？\n少々複雑な気持ちがいたします……。", "zh": "这……该高兴吗？\n我的心情有些复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7500_p", "source_sha256": "7e2afc09e25a74e0e06b4d8622c6fb4d1b6556ed6a579187aaeec9f8ede52c27", "ja": "貴音の持つ独特な雰囲気かな。\n気になって、どんどん他人を惹き付けるんだと思う。", "zh": "应该是因为贵音身上独特的气质吧。\n会让人在不知不觉中被吸引过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7501_008tak", "source_sha256": "7ad1dcff162c4d769fb84e5625111eb13c11fbe8aa08e614b4de67bc94f467a1", "ja": "私のことを、そんな風に思っていたのですね。\nふふっ、なんとも嬉しい限りです。", "zh": "原来您一直是这样看待我的啊。呵呵，真是让我无比开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_7502_008tak", "source_sha256": "b9f08cf04c09f2ac334297aec0b2e41114dd05a16a5a1aa04dc45dd942fcdab1", "ja": "{$P$}の意図はわかりました。\nこの撮影、ありのままの私で皆様を魅了いたします♪", "zh": "我明白了{$P$}的意图。\n这次拍摄，我会以最真实的自己迷倒大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
